OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FAfter a frosty start, with a
OL,6,Frisk of ice on untreated surfaces,
OL,7,Fmany places will remain dry and sunny.
OL,8,FHowever, some patchy cloud will
OL,9,Farrive, along with scattered coastal
OL,10,Fshowers.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FDry
OL,13,Fwith sunny spells, apart for possibly
OL,14,Fisolated coastal showers Saturday and
OL,15,Frain late Monday. Overnight frosts,
OL,16,Fwith potentially patchy freezing mist
OL,17,For fog. Generally rather cold.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
